  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Trained for the lethal magic duel, your bloodline resonates with retributive curses and countermagic. You gain the Occult spellcasting tradition. Your blood magic effect imposes either retributive energy damage on a target creature that attacks you, or grants you a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws against spells until the start of your next turn. You gain dueling spells such as <em>shield</em>, <em>mirror image</em>, <em>counterspell</em>, and <em>resilient sphere</em>.</p>"
    },
